WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.134
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.134 --> 00:00:07.136
Cancelling frees the appointment's place in its slot, and you cannot undo it.

1.3
00:00:07.136 --> 00:00:12.638
Select the appointment on the Appointments board to open Appointment Details.

2.1
00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:17.835
Step 2. Choose how to cancel. Select the menu button with three dots.

2.2
00:00:17.835 --> 00:00:23.643
The Actions menu has two actions that cancel the appointment: Cancel Appointment,

2.3
00:00:23.643 --> 00:00:26.222
and Mark as entered in error.

3.1
00:00:26.222 --> 00:00:28.704
Step 3. Cancel the appointment.

3.2
00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:34.319
Select Cancel Appointment, enter a note, read the warning, and select Confirm.

3.3
00:00:34.319 --> 00:00:42.250
Care shows "Appointment has been cancelled!", and the status becomes Cancelled.
